  "description": "Unleash Speed and Style with the Ace Track Bike\nThe Ace track bike raises the bar in Crew Bike Co.’s lineup, combining cutting-edge design with relentless performance. Purpose-built for the velodrome but equally at home on city streets, this bike is engineered for those who crave speed and standout style.\nIts sleek alloy frame is paired with a lightweight carbon fork, offering a responsive ride that dominates crits and urban sprints alike. Eye-catching graphics add a bold aesthetic to match its blistering pace. Equipped with sealed track hubs and an optimized gear ratio, the Ace track bike delivers smooth, unbridled performance, whether you're chasing podiums or just turning heads.\nKEY FEATURES\n6061 Aluminum Frame – Lightweight, stiff, and built for speed\nCarbon Fiber Fork – Delivers sharp handling and smooth ride quality\nAggressive Track Geometry – Ideal for high-speed maneuvering and control\nThreadless 1-1/8” Headset – Sleek and stable front-end setup\nDeep Alloy Rims – Aerodynamic with a strong road presence\nFront and Rear Brakes Included – Street-legal and ready to ride",
